<mxCell id="c188" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blue class = &amp;laquo;entity&amp;raquo; (one table in schema.sql); purple = &amp;laquo;enumeration&amp;raquo;; folder = package (owning module, CMP-xxx)&lt;br&gt;Solid line = association (multiplicity + role at each end; open arrow = navigable direction)&lt;br&gt;Filled diamond = composition (part deleted with whole: ON DELETE CASCADE)&lt;br&gt;Hollow diamond = aggregation (shared, part outlives whole: ON DELETE RESTRICT)&lt;br&gt;Dashed open arrow = dependency (reference held inside a JSON snapshot, no foreign key)&lt;br&gt;Attributes: - private, + public operation; {id} = key, [0..1] = nullable; created_at/updated_at and foreign-key columns are omitted (FKs are the associations)&lt;br&gt;Join tables without own data (knowledge_chunk_sources, publication_facts, publication_media) are drawn as many-to-many associations" style="rounded=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="1468" width="760" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c189" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraint notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;{Trip.dayCount 1..3; TripDay.dayIndex ≤ dayCount} (BRU-007)&lt;br&gt;{TripStop.place is in Trip.city; TripStop.publication belongs to TripStop.place} (BR-006)&lt;br&gt;{at most one PUBLISHED CatalogPublication per Place} · {at most one ACTIVE PlanPreview per Trip}&lt;br&gt;{RouteLeg joins two TripStops of the same TripDay; value only from routing provider} (BRU-006)&lt;br&gt;{GuideSession has a Place or a Trip context} (FR-056)" style="shape=note;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFF0;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="1678" width="760" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
